# Agent worker boundary

- **Product code:** `src/lunar_navigator/`, `web/`, root `tests/` — submission build.
- **Agent worker:** `builder/` — handoff, harness scripts, skills, task/decision logs, evidence.
- Read **`builder/AGENTS.md`** before routing tasks. Edit handoff at **`builder/agent_handoff.json`** only.
- Run harness via **`builder/scripts/`** (paths are repo-aware). Master Reference stays at **`Master-Reference/`**.
- Skills canonical under **`builder/.cursor/skills/`** (root `.cursor/skills/*` symlinks for discovery).